{"id": "70285", "title": "汉武晨曦", "author": "夜惠美", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 27, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70285/70285s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70285.htm", "intro": "一朝梦醒，魂穿汉武，阿娇是母，刘彻为父。\n    金屋藏娇，人间美谈，姐弟情缘，帝后相携。\n    卫氏子夫，已嫁他妇，皇后阿娇，跋扈不在。\n    汉武施政，略有不同，强汉盛世，群英璀璨。\n    向天借胆，大问一声，哪只蝴蝶，如此强悍？\n    封闭了金手指的女主，平凡公主奋斗史！", "base": "files/article/html/70/70285", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "10918763.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10918764.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10918765.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10918766.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10918767.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10918768.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "10918769.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "10918770.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-90", "file": "10918771.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-100", "file": "10918772.html", "available": false}, {"title": "101-110", "file": "10918773.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-120", "file": "10918774.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-130", "file": "10918775.html", "available": false}, {"title": "131-140", "file": "10918776.html", "available": false}, {"title": "141-150", "file": "10918777.html", "available": false}, {"title": "151-160", "file": "10918778.html", "available": true}, {"title": "161-170", "file": "10918779.html", "available": true}, {"title": "171-180", "file": "10918780.html", "available": true}, {"title": "181-190", "file": "10918781.html", "available": true}, {"title": "201-205", "file": "10918782.html", "available": true}, {"title": "206-220", "file": "10918783.html", "available": true}, {"title": "221-228", "file": "10918784.html", "available": true}, {"title": "229-235", "file": "10918785.html", "available": true}, {"title": "236-241", "file"